1
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,897
Destiny. Fate. Dreams.

2
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:21,140
These unstoppable ideals are
held deep in the heart of man.

3
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,957
As long as there are people
who seek freedom in this life,

4
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,687
these things shall not
vanish from the earth.

5
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,517
People tell me my head's in the clouds.

6
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,917
I don't care what they say
because I'm dreaming of you.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,597
You are the treasure I found.

8
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,677
So bright, so bold, but so elusive.

9
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,717
It's hard to look away.

10
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,857
Even though it's blinding me.

11
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:55,697
There are no words to
describe how I feel inside.

12
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:58,040
I'm really, really stuck on you.

13
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:02,557
I have to follow my dreams,
however crazy they seem.

14
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:05,617
And I won't stop till I
get there, you will see.

15
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:08,897
You're all I need to have
the strength to believe.

16
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:11,000
We live in wonder.

17
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:21,117
I'm gonna follow my dreams,
however crazy they seem.

18
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:24,177
I'm gonna share them
with you, a love so true.

19
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:27,577
You're all I want,
together we can move on.

20
00:01:27,660 --> 00:01:29,817
We live how we want to.

21
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:32,057
There is no limit to us.

22
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:33,557
We have the power of love.

23
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:36,637
We don't want to live ordinary life.

24
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:39,797
We have a chance to live in paradise.

25
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:42,500
We live in one another.

26
00:01:54,820 --> 00:01:57,057
True, our country hasn't seen so much.

27
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:59,140
as a drop of rain in three years,

28
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:03,600
but I still put my trust in
the king as I always have.

29
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:07,338
Most of the country still
has faith in him, actually.

30
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:14,100
So many times, I tried to
stop them so many times,

31
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:17,820
but they won't listen to anything I say.

32
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,617
The rebellion isn't stopping.

33
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:21,680
Their strength,

34
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,917
supplies, and men have reached the limit,

35
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:28,257
However their intention is to settle
everything once and for all with the next

36
00:02:28,340 --> 00:02:31,177
attack their backs are against the wall

37
00:02:31,260 --> 00:02:37,680
they're stuck in a corner
prepared for death.

38
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:44,577
Please Vivi you have to stop these fools!

39
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:46,600
from tearing our country apart.

40
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:03,960
Where's Laughter?

41
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,260
He's inside.

42
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:24,611
Toto, old friend, please don't be worried.

43
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:26,280
Vivi, dear.

44
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,080
We'll succeed.

45
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,160
We're going to stop this.

46
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:42,420
Thank you, Vivi.

47
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,240
So long, my princess.

48
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:03,237
We won't see you for a while.

49
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:06,379
As soon as Yuba's up and
running, stop by, princess.

50
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:08,687
Yes, of course I will, Toto.

51
00:04:09,580 --> 00:04:11,417
It's gonna be the best town ever.

52
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:15,382
When it's up and running, I'll
personally give you the grand tour.

53
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:18,480
See ya, Vivi!

54
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:21,277
I hope you grow up to become
a great princess someday!

55
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,190
Yay!

56
00:04:22,273 --> 00:04:23,103
Yay!

57
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:39,631
Koza, I've notified all of our
contacts in the other towns.

58
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,430
This is it.

59
00:04:46,513 --> 00:04:49,000
The time to strike has finally arrived.

60
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:50,577
It has.

61
00:04:50,660 --> 00:04:54,097
We aren't nearly as well-armed
as I would like us to be, though.

62
00:04:54,180 --> 00:04:56,740
I know, but there's no other choice now.

63
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:00,577
We have a duty to protect our country.

64
00:05:00,660 --> 00:05:01,954
No one else can do it.

65
00:05:04,140 --> 00:05:05,100
Only we can.

66
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:08,500
Don't give up!

67
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,800
We're not beat yet!

68
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:10,770
Keep fighting!

69
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:28,520
Stupid kids, Lock here.
Oh, crap. Another one?

70
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,460
Damn it. She's getting away.

71
00:05:35,780 --> 00:05:37,020
Well, Lock there.

72
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,358
She's in the ruins.

73
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:42,260
Let's get up.

74
00:05:44,020 --> 00:05:44,850
Move it.

75
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,100
What happened?

76
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,500
Hey, boy, what happened to you?

77
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:01,524
Hey kid, where's Princess Vivi?

78
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:07,080
Vivi got kidnapped by three men. Oh, no!

79
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:10,740
Bad guys went in the old ruins.

80
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,317
Koza followed him in there.

81
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:14,297
He's trying to save the vice leader.

82
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:15,360
Oh, yeah.

83
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:26,357
Oh princess, where did you go little
girl, let's play a game, come out,

84
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:28,740
come out, wherever you are, come out,

85
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:31,437
come out, I don't see her
anywhere, little Vivi,

86
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,696
you can stop hiding,

87
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,588
we aren't going to hurt you

88
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,148
Found you, little princess.

89
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,240
There you are, girl.

90
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:49,558
Don't go to run off again on me now.

91
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,510
Gotcha!

92
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,710
Peter!

93
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,740
Vivi, are you okay?

94
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:01,800
Yes, I'm fine. Just...

95
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:05,402
Stay down, punk, unless
you want another beating.

96
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:08,460
I'll never surrender the
princess. You got that?

97
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:12,180
Hey, kid, shut your damn mouth
and hand over my meal ticket.

98
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:17,040
I'm done playing games
with you little brats.

99
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:20,040
It's a sword. Let's run. Koza!

100
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,374
Don't worry, princess.

101
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,350
He's harmless.

102
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:24,410
Huh?

103
00:07:24,493 --> 00:07:25,323
Huh?

104
00:07:29,580 --> 00:07:32,100
Protect her to the death, Sansan Clan!

105
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,870
Leader!

106
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,300
Please stop it!

107
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,381
I'm warning you.

108
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:18,200
No way, that damn little kid
managed to knock out our boss.

109
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,620
How dare he?

110
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:23,274
It's time to make that little brat pay.

111
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:25,730
You.

112
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,160
You're dead, boy.

113
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,180
Take that, bastards.

114
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:35,080
Papa! You get him.

115
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,080
Princess Vini, are you okay?

116
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:38,120
You punks!

117
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,500
You desert garbage!

118
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:41,237
Dare to kid them my daughter!

119
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,940
You dirty swine!

120
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,540
We took care of the other, sire.

121
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,380
Chaka! Pell?

122
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:52,800
My friends, why are you two here?

123
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:54,170
That's funny.

124
00:08:54,253 --> 00:08:56,417
We were going to ask
you the same question.

125
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:59,057
What would drive a king to
travel so far from home?

126
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:01,377
These areas are a haven for many bandits.

127
00:09:01,460 --> 00:09:03,166
It's not a place for royalty.

128
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:06,740
Igaram! Kousa's hurt!

129
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:09,331
Yes, he needs immediate medical attention.

130
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:13,020
The others are also in
dire need. Pel! Chaka!

131
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,760
Arrange help at once! Sir!

132
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,840
You children acted very brave.

133
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,600
What's wrong, Vivi?

134
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:27,580
Why are you so distant, child?

135
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:31,540
I was just so scared.

136
00:09:33,460 --> 00:09:34,777
I was scared, too.

137
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:38,919
They were so much bigger and stronger
than us and armed to the teeth.

138
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,717
It's not that.

139
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:46,200
It's just, Leader, you told
them to protect me to the death.

140
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,772
Protect her to the death, Sand Sand Clan!

141
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:56,320
Don't give your life to save mine. Leader.

142
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:00,320
Poor Vivi.

143
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:03,360
Her greatest fear is losing her friends.

144
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:05,530
Hmm.

145
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:16,998
Vivi may be a little girl,
but she's also a princess.

146
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:21,260
Koza, the full measure of gratitude
I owe you cannot be expressed.

147
00:10:21,780 --> 00:10:24,100
So I will simply say, thank you.

148
00:10:24,980 --> 00:10:26,760
But Vivi is one of my friends.

149
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,882
I would do that for all of them.

150
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:30,170
I see.

151
00:10:30,340 --> 00:10:34,817
Then I'm certain the next generation of
Alabasta's people will be in good hands.

152
00:10:34,900 --> 00:10:36,371
Do you love this country?

153
00:10:36,900 --> 00:10:37,730
Yes.

154
00:10:37,813 --> 00:10:38,960
This is my home.

155
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,740
Mine as well.

156
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,500
Excuse me.

157
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,280
Ma-ma-ma!

158
00:10:47,740 --> 00:10:50,217
There is an important matter
that concerns me greatly.

159
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:51,180
What's that?

160
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:54,737
Those who are to lead their
countrymen must be able

161
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:57,797
to make life and death
decisions without hesitation.

162
00:10:57,880 --> 00:11:01,645
Vivi is far too tender-hearted
for such crushing responsibility.

163
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,860
Sir Igarab. Sire?

164
00:11:04,940 --> 00:11:09,100
Just relax, because as I
see it, Alabasta is safe.

165
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:11,810
Hmm.

166
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:19,700
Your Majesty, it is my greatest
desire to serve you until my death.

167
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:22,230
Yuba?

168
00:11:22,860 --> 00:11:26,877
Exactly, and that news comes directly from
your dad to mine so you know it's true.

169
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:28,660
Oh wow, that's great!

170
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:30,797
Your dad asked mine to start a town.

171
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:33,540
He said it would be
built at the Yuba Oasis.

172
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:38,077
That's considered the
crossroads of Alabasta.

173
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:40,277
Where every merchant and
traveler must pass through.

174
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,889
It's the perfect location.

175
00:11:43,420 --> 00:11:45,317
You just wait until it's finished.

176
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:49,440
This town will bring good fortune
and joy to so many people.

177
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,597
Amazing and that's not even the best part.

178
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:58,077
My dad is going to be the
mayor of the whole thing.

179
00:11:58,160 --> 00:12:03,117
You're going to Koza of course, but my
dad wants me to stay here in the capital.

180
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:06,337
He says life will be too hard but I just

181
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:08,877
gotta be where all the
action is and live it.

182
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:11,637
I want to help build the
city with my own two hands.

183
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:15,160
Alabasta will need the
city of Yuba to survive.

184
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,937
We're counting on you, Toto.

185
00:12:25,020 --> 00:12:26,637
Yes, yes. Your majesty.

186
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:29,717
We'll make Yuba a great city for Alabasta.

187
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,557
So long, my princess.

188
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:33,117
We won't see you for a while.

189
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:36,817
As soon as Yuba's up and
running, stop by, princess.

190
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:38,897
Yes, of course I will.

191
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:42,157
It's gonna be the best town
ever when it's up and running.

192
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:44,277
I'll personally give you the grand tour.

193
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,700
Let's move out!

194
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:47,320
See ya, Vivi.

195
00:12:47,580 --> 00:12:50,286
I hope you grow up to
become a great princess.

196
00:12:54,060 --> 00:12:54,890
Okay.

197
00:12:54,973 --> 00:12:57,020
Koza, stop being so arrogant.

198
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:02,397
Koza is correct about Yuba.

199
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:05,833
This new city will bring great
prosperity to the kingdom.

200
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:14,077
well great job today
everybody really we did

201
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:17,697
some good work now let's
all lie down on these

202
00:13:17,780 --> 00:13:19,517
comfy beds and get some well-deserved rest

203
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:22,780
okay we'll need our
strength good night you guys

204
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:29,517
please this whole trip you've been
nothing but lazy why you quit comparing

205
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:33,860
me to you and all the other superhuman
freaks now you're annoying me

206
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:39,857
I think Blue Nose here wins today's award
for laziest talking animal in the desert!

207
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:41,837
You're sure walking
around in the fur coat!

208
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,397
Sanji, I think that's my bad.

209
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:47,577
I know, I thought you might have trouble
sleeping here all alone tonight, Veer.

210
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:50,307
And the award for biggest
perv goes to Sanji.

211
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,273
Alright, slingshot boy.

212
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:55,757
I'm gonna shove that pillow so far
down your throat you'll choke on it.

213
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:58,605
You guys don't think to
understand the concept!

214
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,220
I hope you're ready.

215
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:14,600
Hey, old guy, there's still no water.

216
00:14:14,900 --> 00:14:16,400
My throat's drying up.

217
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:18,584
How can you stand to live here?

218
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,560
It's horrible.

219
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:21,740
The water will come.

220
00:14:21,940 --> 00:14:24,820
The Yuba Oasis still has life in it yet.

221
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:28,700
The dream of Yuba can't be
beaten by a bunch of lousy sand.

222
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:32,397
The king left this land in my
hands and I will keep it alive.

223
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:36,580
I'll dig out the sand as
many times as it takes. Oh.

224
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:38,820
Okay, then, let's dig.

225
00:14:40,100 --> 00:14:44,900
Hey, would you quit your filling the
hole up I spent all this time on? Hm?

226
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:48,286
I'll never get done with
you filling my holes.

227
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:50,980
But I'm digging just like you, old guy.

228
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:53,637
No, I'm digging holes and
you're filling them up.

229
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:57,057
The sand from the hole you're digging
is going into the hole I'm digging.

230
00:14:57,140 --> 00:14:59,199
In other words, you're not helping.

231
00:15:00,880 --> 00:15:02,960
Ah, a mystery hole, huh?

232
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,440
I said knock it off!

233
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,360
Oh, I give up.

234
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:19,900
Well, maybe he figured it out now.

235
00:15:20,060 --> 00:15:21,472
The sand stopped coming.

236
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:26,260
He was able to dig that
in such a short time,

237
00:15:26,420 --> 00:15:29,067
even as tired as he must
be from the journey?

238
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:41,500
Sleep well tonight, you've earned it.

239
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:44,700
Food and water.

240
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:48,120
Pleasant dreams.

241
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:51,320
Give me a break!

242
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:53,167
You've got to be kidding me!

243
00:15:54,380 --> 00:15:57,137
How long are we going to have
to wait around like this?

244
00:15:57,220 --> 00:15:59,937
Are you at least going to
offer some refreshments?

245
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:03,255
I could be practicing my
dance instead of sitting here!

246
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:06,320
Hoo-hoo-hoo! Mr.

247
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,577
Tu, just sit still over
there and wait quietly.

248
00:16:08,660 --> 00:16:09,490
Yeah!

249
00:16:09,573 --> 00:16:10,592
Shut up, you stupid man!

250
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:13,212
You calm down, too, Miss Merry Christmas.

251
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:17,088
I guess it isn't too surprising
that you don't all get along.

252
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:18,350
Oh, well.

253
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:20,814
It isn't necessary that you do, anyway.

254
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,240
Miss all Sunday?

255
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:27,997
Thank you all for coming so far to attend
this gathering of ours in Rain Base.

256
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,377
The city where gambling is the only king,

257
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:33,401
and every man and woman
dreams of going home rich.

