00:29:59,280 --> 00:30:01,437
Why should any of them have
to pay for what's happened

509
00:30:01,520 --> 00:30:04,520
when every last bit of
it is Crocodile's fault?

510
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:13,700
So you're saying it's only
all right for you to die?

511
00:30:14,520 --> 00:30:16,460
No, Luffy, you've gone too far!

512
00:30:16,560 --> 00:30:17,442
Damn it, Luffy!

513
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:25,449
Just being in this country one day and
taking a look around, even I can tell!

514
00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:27,580
Tell what?

515
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:30,629
What this country needs
more than anything!

516
00:30:36,220 --> 00:30:38,380
This Oasis has life in it yet.

517
00:30:38,540 --> 00:30:42,011
The dream of Yuba can't be
beaten by a bunch of lousy sand.

518
00:30:42,100 --> 00:30:44,157
Do you think that
putting just your life on

519
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:46,497
the line is enough to
stop this from happening?

520
00:30:46,580 --> 00:30:51,051
Well, what else exactly should I be
putting on the line with it then, Luffy?

521
00:30:53,220 --> 00:30:55,300
I can't let him get away with this.

522
00:30:57,180 --> 00:30:58,200
What, Luffy?

523
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:04,980
I don't have anything else I can
put on the line. Just... just me.

524
00:31:06,840 --> 00:31:10,797
Well, you can at least try putting
all of our lives on the line together!

525
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:12,420
Aren't we friends, huh?

526
00:31:16,280 --> 00:31:18,060
Well, aren't we friends?

527
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:22,870
There.

528
00:31:23,180 --> 00:31:24,200
Now you see.

529
00:31:24,700 --> 00:31:25,980
Now you understand.

530
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:29,040
Hey, you can cry.

531
00:31:33,360 --> 00:31:34,540
We'll succeed.

532
00:31:35,040 --> 00:31:36,640
We're going to stop this.

533
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:39,740
I know how much you hate this.

534
00:31:40,020 --> 00:31:42,079
You want to get crocodile the most.

535
00:31:55,580 --> 00:31:57,240
So now tell me!

536
00:32:00,540 --> 00:32:02,460
Where can I find Crocodile?!
